decompdecomp
============

Copyright (C) 2024-2026 n-delic and contributors.
decomp.wtf, which decompdecomp continues, is by Sam Wolfs (@i12bp8) and contributors.

This repository is an Android port of decompdecomp. It includes the source of
decompdecomp at the commit in UPSTREAM_COMMIT, with small changes marked
"ANDROID PATCH" (running splat in-process, a mobile stylesheet, and an entry
point for the app). The original source and this port are licensed under the
GNU Affero General Public License, version 3 only (AGPL-3.0-only). See LICENSE.

The Android app uses:
  - Chaquopy (MIT) and CPython (PSF-2.0)
  - capstone (BSD-3-Clause)
  - rabbitizer, spimdisasm, splat (MIT)
  - Starlette (BSD-3-Clause), Uvicorn (BSD-3-Clause), HTTPX (BSD-3-Clause)
  - PyYAML (MIT), intervaltree (Apache-2.0), tqdm (MPL-2.0 and MIT),
    colorama (BSD-3-Clause), pyelftools (Public Domain), n64img (MIT)

No game, ROM or copyrighted asset is included in this repository or in the APK.
